OL,3,ASociety needs to act to help white
OL,4,Aworking-class pupils, inquiry says
OL,5,
OL,6,FAction from "across society" is needed
OL,7,Fto help improve the educational
OL,8,Foutcomes of white working-class
OL,9,Fchildren, the co-chair of an
OL,10,Findependent inquiry looking into the
OL,11,Fissue has said.
OL,13,FThe inquiry's first report, published
OL,14,Fthis summer, concluded that
OL,15,Fonce-in-a-generation reforms were
OL,16,Fneeded to fix a system "not serving the
OL,17,Finterests of white working-class
OL,18,Fchildren".
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
