OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ASociety needs to act to help white
OL,4,Aworking-class pupils, inquiry says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe next phase will focus on early
OL,7,Fyears children and teenagers aged 14 to
OL,8,F19, aiming for a stronger start at
OL,9,Fprimary school and improving older
OL,10,Fstudents' routes through education into
OL,11,Fsuccessful careers.
OL,13,FEducation Secretary Lucy Powell said
OL,14,Fshe was "backing" the inquiry to "get
OL,15,Fto the heart of the barriers holding
OL,16,Fchildren back".
